title="Google Tag Manager container" height="0" width="0" style="display:none;visibility:hidden"></iframe></noscript>
<!-- End Google Tag Manager (noscript) -->

  <!-- Skip Link -->
  <main id="main-content" class="seo-page"><section class="seo-hero"><p class="seo-kicker">Remote care enquiry</p><h1>Ask whether teleconsultation is suitable</h1>
<div class="seo-answer"><strong>Direct answer:</strong> Teleconsultation at Mind Grace follows the Telemedicine Practice Guidelines of India (2020). Some follow-up and counselling conversations may be possible remotely, but remote care is not suitable for every person, concern, or situation &mdash; suitability is decided case by case.</div><p class="seo-lead">Some follow-up or counselling conversations may be possible remotely, but teleconsultation is not suitable for every person, concern, or situation.</p><div class="seo-actions"><a class="btn" href="/contact">Ask the clinic</a><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/book">Request an appointment</a></div></section><section class="seo-section"><h2>Before a remote appointment</h2><div class="seo-grid"><article class="seo-card"><h3>Eligibility</h3><p>The clinic must confirm clinician availability, location, identity, consent, privacy, and whether remote care is clinically appropriate.</p></article><article class="seo-card"><h3>Privacy</h3><p>Use a private room and a reliable connection. Share only the information requested through the clinic’s approved booking channel.</p></article><article class="seo-card"><h3>Limits</h3><p>Remote care may require an in-person review, examination, testing, referral, or local emergency support.</p></article></div><div class="seo-note"><strong>Emergency warning:</strong> Do not use teleconsultation, email, WhatsApp, or this website for immediate danger or crisis support. Call 112 or go to the nearest emergency department.</div></section><section class="seo-section"><h2>Consent and follow-up</h2><p>Ask how consent, prescriptions, records, fees, cancellations, and follow-up will work before the consultation. Read the clinic’s <a href="/privacy">privacy information</a>.</p></section>    
  </main>
</Layout>
